      "description": "The key diagnosis panel. Estimated ingress is net memory growth plus completed memory reclaim. Memory reclaimed is the master eviction completion counter. Exact client SSD write appears only if mooncake_ssd_write_bytes_total is exported to Prometheus.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
